/Title (The Club Installation marks the beginning of a new Rotary Year for every Interact Club and sets the tone for the journey ahead. Clubs are encouraged to plan their Installation Ceremony at the earliest to ensure a smooth transition of leadership and establish their vision and goals for the year. This document serves as a preliminary guide for Interact Clubs and their Sponsor Rotary Clubs in planning and conducting the Installation Ceremony, while ensuring smooth coordination with the District throughout the planning and execution process. The guidelines provided are recommendatory in nature and are intended to assist clubs in organizing a professional and memorable installation.)
